  "goodToKnow": "Die Festung is a fortress: die Festung Königstein in Saxony, die Festung Ehrenbreitstein in Koblenz, both popular sights. A medieval knight's castle is die Burg, and a palace das Schloss. Festung Europa (Fortress Europe) is used critically for the EU's strict border policies. From fest (firm, solid), not das Fest (party). Die Festungshaft was a mild form of imprisonment in older German law."
